  - m_Id: 4983693864960
    m_Localized: "This department requires people who can communicate clearly and
      understand others\u2019 needs easily.\nThe ability to adapt one\u2019s language
      is essential to help clients and colleagues effectively."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032125493248
    m_Localized: 'This department requires great attention to detail and consistency
      in following procedures.

      Precision is essential to spot hidden errors
      and ensure reliable products.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5457478250496
    m_Localized: 'This department seeks people able to notice visual and sensory
      nuances.

      Aesthetic sensitivity and attention to detail help create enjoyable
      experiences for users.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5497760346112
    m_Localized: 'In this department, it is important to solve complex problems and
      think logically.

      The ability to plan and maintain focus is essential
      to successfully complete projects.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5560750403584
    m_Localized: 'This department requires curiosity and dedication to constantly
      analyze and improve.

      The ability to spot patterns and experiment with
      new solutions is essential to innovate and help the company grow.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617612582912
    m_Localized: "This department requires creativity combined with the ability to
      communicate messages clearly.\nKnowing how to spark users\u2019 visual and
      auditory curiosity is essential to reach and engage the audience."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
